WEBVTT

00:33.590 --> 00:34.450
What happened?

00:35.470 --> 00:36.920
You've been in a coma for a whole day.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.920
Is this how the Plague gets treated?

00:39.250 --> 00:39.740
You...

00:40.650 --> 00:42.170
Are you really the Plague?

00:42.650 --> 00:44.250
You have a really sensitive nose,

00:44.250 --> 00:45.980
very much like a friend of mine.

00:46.100 --> 00:47.340
You can even tell the faint smell

00:47.340 --> 00:48.170
of turmeric.

00:48.820 --> 00:50.570
A cheater has to practice for a long time.

00:50.570 --> 00:51.170
By the way,

00:52.890 --> 00:53.610
except for the bedding,

00:53.610 --> 00:54.780
I've packed almost all your luggage.

00:54.780 --> 00:55.760
Take a look

00:56.100 --> 00:57.830
and see if anything is missing.

01:01.020 --> 01:02.950
Nothing's missing—it's all here.

01:03.700 --> 01:04.280
But

01:04.700 --> 01:06.230
why are we packing luggage?

01:06.450 --> 01:07.780
Because we're leaving.

01:08.130 --> 01:10.320
What? W-We are leaving?

01:11.370 --> 01:12.810
Do you think we can still

01:12.810 --> 01:13.810
stay on this ship?

01:17.340 --> 01:17.930
Wait,

01:18.570 --> 01:19.780
it should be you

01:19.800 --> 01:20.900
who can't stay here any longer.

01:20.900 --> 01:22.010
What does it have to do with me?

01:22.010 --> 01:23.450
I am the Sea Plague,

01:23.570 --> 01:25.340
and you are the Plague's cousin.

01:25.340 --> 01:26.000
How many people

01:26.000 --> 01:27.620
do you think will come
seeking revenge on you?

01:27.620 --> 01:28.730
Once you go ashore,

01:28.780 --> 01:29.760
they will torture you

01:29.760 --> 01:31.260
and interrogate you about my whereabouts.

01:31.260 --> 01:34.340
Someone might even cut off
your little friend down there.

01:34.340 --> 01:34.810
I...

01:35.000 --> 01:36.800
I-I am not your cousin!

01:38.039 --> 01:39.229
Do you guys believe him?

01:39.229 --> 01:40.850
-No.
-No, we don't.

01:41.350 --> 01:42.710
I'm really not his cousin!

01:42.710 --> 01:44.080
I don't know this guy!

01:45.180 --> 01:46.250
You... You guys...

01:48.450 --> 01:49.979
What's wrong with you guys?

01:53.500 --> 01:54.340
Aren't you

01:54.729 --> 01:56.710
the knight who protects
Chinese passengers?

01:56.710 --> 01:57.750
Why are they hiding from you

01:57.750 --> 01:58.890
and so afraid of you?

01:59.350 --> 02:00.070
Knight?

02:00.870 --> 02:01.710
There's no knight here.

02:01.710 --> 02:02.570
I am the Plague.

02:03.480 --> 02:06.210
The Plague kills those
with a guilty conscience.

02:06.210 --> 02:09.340
Ordinary people all have things
they feel guilty about.

02:09.900 --> 02:10.530
You are not afraid of me.

02:10.530 --> 02:11.970
You've got no guilt in your heart.

02:11.970 --> 02:13.430
Of course, I have no guilt.

02:14.590 --> 02:15.710
Those with no guilt are

02:15.710 --> 02:16.240
either very kind,

02:16.240 --> 02:16.780
or really evil,

02:16.780 --> 02:17.530
or extremely foolish.

02:17.530 --> 02:18.590
Which type are you?

02:20.400 --> 02:20.880
I...

02:21.000 --> 02:22.180
I-I'm none of them.

02:23.340 --> 02:26.230
Is it that hard not to do anything
against your conscience?

02:26.230 --> 02:27.280
Ask them.

02:30.340 --> 02:31.480
I really don't know how you managed

02:31.480 --> 02:33.610
to grow up being this blunt and honest.

02:34.400 --> 02:35.660
I am an accountant.

02:36.470 --> 02:38.670
An accountant should be firm and clear.

02:38.750 --> 02:40.420
I make a living by being blunt and honest.

02:40.420 --> 02:42.210
If something requires flexibility,

02:42.210 --> 02:42.860
I believe

02:42.880 --> 02:44.670
there will be flexible people

02:44.690 --> 02:45.550
to deal with it.

02:45.840 --> 02:46.650
Now that the job

02:46.650 --> 02:48.570
of accountant has existed
since ancient times,

02:48.570 --> 02:50.610
I believe I can survive.

02:51.740 --> 02:52.800
Chivalry.

02:53.710 --> 02:55.970
Some British value this.

02:57.210 --> 02:59.140
There are some British in Nanyang.

02:59.190 --> 03:00.900
So you will indeed do well there.

03:00.900 --> 03:02.400
But when you arrive in Jinfan,

03:02.400 --> 03:04.130
the people there will probably bury you

03:04.130 --> 03:06.460
under the railway tracks as a foundation.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.970
You are lucky.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.630
You were supposed to die today,

03:12.630 --> 03:14.100
but you didn't.

03:14.470 --> 03:16.400
It means you have really good luck.

03:16.680 --> 03:18.210
Then I must take you with me,

03:19.180 --> 03:20.980
as what I am going to do next today

03:21.300 --> 03:22.120
needs luck.

03:23.030 --> 03:24.140
What do you mean?

03:24.960 --> 03:25.590
Guys.

03:28.020 --> 03:29.820
Good times are always fleeting.

03:30.280 --> 03:32.050
But we will meet again soon.

03:33.090 --> 03:35.290
I will remember every one of your faces.

03:35.840 --> 03:37.430
I will know every bad thing

03:37.430 --> 03:38.210
you say about me

03:38.210 --> 03:39.140
behind my back.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.630
Someone will tell me about

03:40.630 --> 03:41.890
every bad thing you do.

03:42.130 --> 03:44.430
Go back and tell what you saw today

03:44.430 --> 03:46.460
to 10 of your friends.

03:47.130 --> 03:47.800
Otherwise,

03:48.690 --> 03:51.690
you will eventually run into me
someday in the future.

03:54.160 --> 03:55.100
Take the luggage

03:55.300 --> 03:57.500
and go wait for me on the boat I prepared.

03:58.740 --> 03:59.540
See you later.

04:12.590 --> 04:13.030
You...

04:13.030 --> 04:14.530
What are you doing?

04:15.220 --> 04:16.320
You Plague,

04:16.420 --> 04:18.339
why are you so unpredictable?

04:18.750 --> 04:19.899
I'm not a Plague.

04:20.630 --> 04:21.920
I'm your savior.

04:21.980 --> 04:23.180
What savior?

04:23.200 --> 04:24.240
You are just a madman,

04:24.240 --> 04:25.210
a psychopath!

04:25.310 --> 04:27.140
I'm going to Jinfan to find my family.

04:27.140 --> 04:28.870
Where are you kidnapping me to?

04:28.920 --> 04:30.920
Do you think I want to care about you?

04:34.780 --> 04:36.400
Take it and row over there.

04:36.570 --> 04:37.750
No, I'm not going!

04:38.080 --> 04:38.710
You...

04:46.690 --> 04:48.260
Bastards on the Nan'an,

04:48.659 --> 04:49.659
I am back.

04:52.570 --> 04:53.360
Row harder!

04:54.450 --> 04:54.970
Row!

05:02.710 --> 05:03.900
Psychopath.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.360
Almost there.

05:16.270 --> 05:17.870
Wake up, we're almost there.

05:22.690 --> 05:23.380
I haven't asked you

05:23.380 --> 05:24.510
about your name yet.

05:26.310 --> 05:27.540
My name is He Jianxi,

05:28.690 --> 05:30.870
from "When shall we trim
the candle by the west window."

05:30.870 --> 05:32.200
My name is Zhang Hailou,

05:32.690 --> 05:33.930
from "The moon is like a mirror
flying in the sky,

05:33.930 --> 05:35.590
and clouds form a sea mirage."

05:35.870 --> 05:37.560
You can also call me Salty Zhang.

05:37.560 --> 05:40.360
Salty is a homophone
for what Balai people call me.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.350
Is this a crystal palace?

05:51.710 --> 05:55.740
[The Nan'an]

07:20.480 --> 07:26.810
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

07:27.110 --> 07:29.780
[Episode 8]

07:55.230 --> 07:56.550
Where are we?

07:57.040 --> 07:58.100
You even brought wine?

07:58.100 --> 07:59.090
Where are we?

07:59.690 --> 08:00.720
In the Nan'an,

08:01.570 --> 08:02.490
a steamboat

08:03.160 --> 08:04.420
heading for Xiacheng.

08:05.160 --> 08:05.870
Xiacheng?

08:06.390 --> 08:07.990
Why are we going to Xiacheng?

08:08.240 --> 08:09.480
I want to go to Jinfan!

08:09.480 --> 08:11.480
Bro, what on earth are you doing?

08:11.480 --> 08:12.680
I'm saving your life.

08:14.060 --> 08:16.180
You're so stubborn but still alive.

08:16.250 --> 08:17.310
Your ancestors must've accumulated a lot

08:17.310 --> 08:19.040
of merit and saved many people.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.930
My ancestors have accumulated merit?

08:22.310 --> 08:23.360
If they had done it,

08:23.360 --> 08:24.690
I wouldn't have met you!

08:33.179 --> 08:33.840
No way.

08:35.100 --> 08:36.390
I can't go to Xiacheng.

08:38.270 --> 08:39.630
You bastard.

08:39.909 --> 08:41.240
I'm going to Jinfan.

08:41.289 --> 08:43.770
My younger brother is
still waiting for me!

08:45.640 --> 08:47.650
What? Should I throw you overboard now,

08:47.650 --> 08:48.780
so you can swim back?

08:50.630 --> 08:51.510
Listen,

08:51.980 --> 08:53.010
no one would believe

08:53.010 --> 08:55.600
that someone could sneak
onto a ship in these waters.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.860
This ship is very safe,

08:56.960 --> 08:57.810
with neither bad sailors

08:57.810 --> 08:59.030
nor scammers like those guys.

08:59.030 --> 09:00.620
It's much safer than the Bowne.

09:00.620 --> 09:01.480
So don't worry.

09:02.150 --> 09:03.750
After we arrive in Xiacheng,

09:04.220 --> 09:05.950
I will let you go back to Jinfan.

09:06.220 --> 09:07.680
It's just a little detour.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.490
Then tell me the truth.

09:09.860 --> 09:11.080
Who exactly are you?

09:13.740 --> 09:14.980
Who on earth are you?

09:15.000 --> 09:16.310
Who are you?

09:16.340 --> 09:17.320
What are you doing now?

09:17.320 --> 09:19.520
I'm taking you to the dining hall first.

09:31.190 --> 09:31.840
That way.

09:31.880 --> 09:32.490
Let's go!

09:34.320 --> 09:35.580
Where are we going?

09:42.230 --> 09:44.360
Just sit here and wait for me to return.

09:45.260 --> 09:46.520
What if someone comes?

09:47.190 --> 09:48.560
There are a lot of drunks here.
Just pretend to be drunk.

09:48.560 --> 09:50.090
I'm sure no one will notice.

09:51.350 --> 09:52.580
Where are you going?

09:55.580 --> 09:57.370
There are 10 medical staff
on the ship in total,

09:57.370 --> 09:58.220
including 3 doctors

09:58.220 --> 09:59.060
and 7 nurses.

10:00.580 --> 10:02.250
The murderers who spread
the Twilight Grass

10:02.250 --> 10:03.320
are among them.

10:03.820 --> 10:04.700
At this time,

10:04.700 --> 10:07.080
there must be someone
on duty in the clinic.

10:07.080 --> 10:07.920
Find the murderers,

10:07.920 --> 10:09.720
keep one to take back to Nanyang,

10:09.880 --> 10:11.140
and get rid of the rest.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.440
Could the murderer be someone else?

11:49.510 --> 11:51.130
You're Mr. Zhang Ruipu's nephew,

11:51.130 --> 11:52.530
Mr. Zhang Hailou, right?

11:56.910 --> 11:58.030
This wound...

12:13.030 --> 12:13.670
Oh, no.

12:14.340 --> 12:16.600
This powder is made from Twilight Grass.

13:22.430 --> 13:24.360
Who took you to sneak onto the ship?

13:27.020 --> 13:28.400
He brought me on board.

13:30.940 --> 13:32.670
Who are you? What are you doing?

14:14.880 --> 14:16.090
Come over here.

14:17.290 --> 14:18.860
Let me show you some "love."

15:17.050 --> 15:17.740
Plague?

15:18.200 --> 15:19.010
Are you okay?

15:20.320 --> 15:21.110
Cousin,

15:22.250 --> 15:23.650
you really ratted me out.

15:23.650 --> 15:24.240
No.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.180
The patrolmen found me.

15:27.460 --> 15:28.570
I had no other choice...

15:28.570 --> 15:30.370
You did a good job ratting me out.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.340
It doesn't really matter anyway.

15:32.410 --> 15:33.530
After all, I am a legitimate

15:33.530 --> 15:34.790
first-class passenger on this ship.

15:34.790 --> 15:36.590
You are the one without a ticket.

15:40.960 --> 15:41.890
Can he be saved?

15:43.050 --> 15:44.240
He was killed in one blow.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.700
He died without much pain.

15:49.220 --> 15:49.930
Cousin,

15:51.390 --> 15:52.270
you didn't kill anyone,

15:52.270 --> 15:53.870
but they died because of you.

15:55.890 --> 15:57.930
What on earth is going on here?

15:58.000 --> 16:00.150
You said this ship was very safe!

16:00.170 --> 16:02.070
W-What exactly do you do?

16:02.110 --> 16:03.840
I told you, I'll tell you later.

16:05.660 --> 16:06.820
But these people

16:08.030 --> 16:08.910
are robbers.

16:10.000 --> 16:12.170
If you don't let go
of our personal grudges,

16:12.170 --> 16:14.230
the money on this ship will be robbed,

16:14.580 --> 16:16.150
and the women will be abused.

16:16.150 --> 16:17.610
The women won't be abused.

16:18.270 --> 16:20.100
One of them is a woman.

16:20.370 --> 16:21.390
I can smell it.

16:24.150 --> 16:25.550
Like Shrimpie's nose...

16:26.890 --> 16:28.510
But if what you said is true,

16:28.530 --> 16:30.260
and they are robbers,

16:30.510 --> 16:32.030
we should immediately

16:32.030 --> 16:33.890
inform everyone else on the ship.

16:34.480 --> 16:36.080
We might not make it that far.

16:37.010 --> 16:38.270
What are you doing now?

16:39.840 --> 16:40.900
What is this smell?

16:42.460 --> 16:42.980
No,

16:43.390 --> 16:44.190
wait a minute.

16:44.250 --> 16:44.990
Don't go in.

16:45.320 --> 16:46.320
Do you smell that?

16:46.340 --> 16:47.800
The smell coming out of this room

16:47.800 --> 16:48.680
is so weird.

16:55.210 --> 16:56.870
How many people died in there?

16:57.500 --> 16:59.630
Why does it smell so strongly of blood?

17:00.370 --> 17:01.010
Cousin.

17:02.360 --> 17:04.460
Look, this room is actually a trap.

17:05.000 --> 17:05.920
A trap?

17:06.810 --> 17:07.770
What trap?

17:08.200 --> 17:10.460
These assassins must have been prepared

17:10.530 --> 17:12.069
the moment they knew Zhang Ruipu's sailor

17:12.069 --> 17:13.140
was guiding me.

17:13.510 --> 17:14.480
Assassins?

17:15.510 --> 17:18.250
Didn't you just say they were robbers?

17:20.000 --> 17:21.940
If I hadn't been forced
to jump into the sea,

17:21.940 --> 17:23.720
I would have gone
to investigate the clinic

17:23.720 --> 17:24.810
and fallen into their trap,

17:24.810 --> 17:26.470
and I might have been dead now.

17:28.500 --> 17:29.330
Who are you?

17:29.350 --> 17:30.830
But I lucked out

17:31.010 --> 17:33.210
and arrived here nearly half a day late.

17:33.480 --> 17:35.310
This was enough
to make the assassins ambushing here

17:35.310 --> 17:36.510
let their guard down.

17:42.220 --> 17:43.420
Were it not for you...

17:44.800 --> 17:46.800
Were it not for these coincidences,

17:48.380 --> 17:49.770
I would have ended up
just like them right now,

17:49.770 --> 17:51.170
lying dead on the ground.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.370
These bodies...

17:55.180 --> 17:56.550
Were they killed by you

17:57.200 --> 17:58.500
or those robbers?

17:59.090 --> 18:02.150
I thought these doctors
on the ship were the murderers,

18:02.310 --> 18:03.560
but now they are dead.

18:04.330 --> 18:05.940
That means apart from them,

18:06.880 --> 18:10.420
there must be someone else involved
in spreading the toxic weed.

18:10.420 --> 18:12.220
These people are highly skilled

18:12.380 --> 18:13.710
and ruthless fighters.

18:14.770 --> 18:15.590
Or maybe these doctors

18:15.590 --> 18:16.640
were just used by them

18:16.640 --> 18:18.170
and have now been silenced.

18:18.590 --> 18:20.390
Burn all the evidence.

18:20.550 --> 18:22.240
Don't let anyone go!

18:31.080 --> 18:32.770
That sounds like their style.

18:49.880 --> 18:52.280
These are traces of Twilight Grass Poison.

18:52.840 --> 18:55.240
They were killed by Twilight Grass Poison.

19:01.610 --> 19:04.090
The assassins turned the corpses
into traps.

19:04.090 --> 19:05.020
Once triggered,

19:05.430 --> 19:08.360
Twilight Grass Poison will spray
from their mouths.

19:27.790 --> 19:28.610
So this must be

19:29.480 --> 19:31.190
a storage device

19:31.680 --> 19:32.900
for Twilight Grass.

19:44.920 --> 19:45.570
Plague,

19:45.980 --> 19:47.080
I'm begging you.

19:47.140 --> 19:48.970
Can you tell me the truth?

19:49.240 --> 19:51.380
Can I make it to Jinfan alive?

19:56.240 --> 19:56.970
It seems that

19:57.830 --> 19:59.630
the murderers have been digging

19:59.740 --> 20:02.000
into Twilight Grass just like Shrimpie.

20:02.570 --> 20:03.370
Look, Cousin.

20:04.550 --> 20:05.940
This is a toxic weed device

20:05.940 --> 20:08.200
that contains a highly poisonous plant.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.880
Just one small unit like this

20:09.880 --> 20:11.640
is enough to kill 10 adult men.

20:15.420 --> 20:16.420
Using this poison

20:16.770 --> 20:17.810
to kill only you is

20:18.250 --> 20:19.570
indeed overkill.

20:20.440 --> 20:23.240
Not to mention that they've prepared
so much of it.

20:26.960 --> 20:29.420
Are they going to kill everyone
on this ship?

20:32.010 --> 20:33.460
What's wrong with you?

20:33.530 --> 20:34.310
Didn't you tell me

20:34.310 --> 20:36.570
that the Nan'an was safer than the Bowne?

20:37.530 --> 20:39.330
They wouldn't go as far
as killing everyone on the ship.

20:39.330 --> 20:40.370
But one thing for sure is

20:40.370 --> 20:42.370
that they're targeting not just me.

20:42.750 --> 20:44.280
But besides those patients

20:44.680 --> 20:46.510
seeking treatment and me,

20:46.530 --> 20:48.460
who else would come to this clinic?

20:57.440 --> 21:00.170
Could it be anyone
who has traced it to the clinic?

21:00.730 --> 21:02.820
Their real target is anyone

21:03.310 --> 21:04.660
who wants to investigate

21:04.660 --> 21:06.720
Twilight Grass Poison on the Nan'an.

21:08.760 --> 21:11.370
Is that what
the Pitcher Plant Project means?

21:15.370 --> 21:16.900
[N P]

21:15.420 --> 21:16.190
Pitcher...

21:17.270 --> 21:18.100
Pitcher...

21:18.680 --> 21:19.350
Pitcher...

21:21.000 --> 21:21.590
Cousin,

21:22.100 --> 21:23.080
hide this.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.510
You...

21:24.850 --> 21:25.260
I...

21:28.440 --> 21:32.530
[Sailor Duty Room]

21:51.530 --> 21:53.310
Song Cai. Song Cai.

21:53.350 --> 21:54.310
Song Cai.

21:54.920 --> 21:55.440
Song...

21:55.950 --> 21:56.840
[Sailor Roster of the Nan'an]

21:56.860 --> 22:01.990
[Song Cai] [Zhang Haiyun]

22:00.440 --> 22:01.510
Zhang Haiyun?

22:06.520 --> 22:09.520
There was indeed someone
from the Southern Archives.

22:17.630 --> 22:18.990
[He Yufen] [Du Rusong]

22:19.370 --> 22:21.650
[Liu Yang, Zhang Jie, Li Fengchun]

22:25.430 --> 22:25.790
[Sun Lei, Zhang Siye]

22:25.820 --> 22:26.800
[Li Fengchun]

22:26.890 --> 22:27.680
[328 Li Fengchun]

22:27.830 --> 22:29.200
[Zhao Qiaoke]

22:29.230 --> 22:30.440
[325 Zhao Qiaoke]

22:30.550 --> 22:31.820
[Dong Haishu]

22:31.930 --> 22:34.050
[305 Dong Haishu]

22:35.660 --> 22:37.410
NP refers to pitcher plants.

22:35.970 --> 22:38.420
[N P]

22:38.030 --> 22:38.830
You were warning

22:38.830 --> 22:41.830
the agents boarding the ship
to investigate after you

22:41.920 --> 22:43.320
that the entire Nan'an is

22:43.330 --> 22:46.060
a trap to hunt down
the Southern Archives agents.

22:46.270 --> 22:47.480
Anyone from the Archives

22:47.480 --> 22:49.230
who boards the Nan'an
to investigate the case

22:49.230 --> 22:50.940
will be led by the clues
designed by the assassins

22:50.940 --> 22:52.140
into a trap

22:52.570 --> 22:53.800
and then get killed.

23:02.830 --> 23:04.560
They are all from the Archives.

23:06.260 --> 23:07.550
Are they dead?

23:08.920 --> 23:10.070
Are they all dead?

23:11.460 --> 23:12.140
So,

23:13.060 --> 23:16.330
the murderers deliberately used
the Nan'an to spread Twilight Grass

23:16.330 --> 23:20.060
so as to attract people from the Archives
to board and investigate.

23:20.090 --> 23:21.690
Then what is the Evil God for?

23:22.140 --> 23:23.730
To bewitch and eliminate us?

23:23.630 --> 23:24.510
[305 Dong Haishu]

23:25.270 --> 23:27.770
The agents came from everywhere
and didn't know each other.

23:27.770 --> 23:30.270
Ordinary agents were killed
by the assassins.

23:30.270 --> 23:31.830
Agents who found clues followed them

23:31.830 --> 23:32.910
and fell into the trap,

23:32.910 --> 23:34.700
either being killed
by Twilight Grass Poison

23:34.700 --> 23:35.590
[325 Jo Qiao Ke]

23:34.960 --> 23:36.820
or being wiped out by the Evil God.

23:41.010 --> 23:41.650
[328 Li Fengchun]

24:28.180 --> 24:28.960
It's blood.

24:30.640 --> 24:33.000
So Song Cai used flies
to find bloodstains

24:33.480 --> 24:35.340
and figure out where people died.

24:49.530 --> 24:51.070
Fourteen agents were killed

24:51.070 --> 24:52.870
in first and second class alone.

24:53.330 --> 24:55.990
How many more agents were killed
in third class?

24:56.770 --> 24:58.570
Why would the murderers do this?

24:58.770 --> 25:01.430
Is it revenge for my destruction
of Panhua Reef?

25:01.960 --> 25:04.020
Are those warlords the masterminds?

25:04.530 --> 25:08.660
Did they set up such a complicated trap
to take revenge on an organization?

25:08.790 --> 25:09.350
Wait,

25:09.750 --> 25:11.750
did Zhang Ruipu know this was a trap?

25:12.550 --> 25:15.280
You go to the ship
to help me investigate the case.

25:17.110 --> 25:18.720
So you wanted those assassins

25:18.720 --> 25:19.590
to mistake me for you

25:19.590 --> 25:21.720
and let me die in your place on the ship.

25:25.510 --> 25:26.500
So you never planned

25:26.500 --> 25:28.900
to let me get off the ship
in the first place.

25:29.420 --> 25:30.180
This is bad.

25:32.150 --> 25:34.280
Shrimpie is of no value to Zhang Ruipu.

25:34.700 --> 25:35.610
Would he...

25:37.440 --> 25:38.040
No,

25:38.790 --> 25:40.120
as smart as Shrimpie is,

25:40.400 --> 25:41.730
he wouldn't die so fast.

25:47.590 --> 25:48.580
I'll make the ship turn around

25:48.580 --> 25:50.780
and go back to Xucheng to save Shrimpie.

25:57.290 --> 25:58.590
What are you doing now?

26:01.030 --> 26:02.090
Catching bad guys.

26:06.540 --> 26:09.640
Does this have anything to do
with you throwing the dead bodies?

26:09.640 --> 26:10.400
If someone comes,

26:10.400 --> 26:11.350
can you explain

26:11.350 --> 26:13.480
your relationship with these bodies?

26:15.250 --> 26:16.310
You've got a point.

26:19.440 --> 26:20.600
Cousin, follow me.

26:21.900 --> 26:23.680
Where to now?

26:25.240 --> 26:26.200
To meet

26:26.510 --> 26:27.510
our old rivals.

26:39.680 --> 26:42.430
About the robbers you mentioned before,

26:42.960 --> 26:44.220
are they...

26:44.010 --> 26:45.740
[Go up and down the auxiliary ladders
steadily and slowly.]

26:45.540 --> 26:47.070
You should have drunk less.

26:48.850 --> 26:49.310
This...

26:49.870 --> 26:50.730
You're blotto.

26:58.770 --> 27:00.400
Are those robbers you mentioned

27:00.400 --> 27:01.680
the same guys who killed

27:01.680 --> 27:03.140
the people in the clinic?

27:07.880 --> 27:09.570
The robbers are still hiding
in the third-class cabin.

27:09.570 --> 27:10.550
To uphold justice,

27:10.550 --> 27:12.030
we must expose them.

27:12.900 --> 27:13.390
Wait,

27:14.180 --> 27:15.880
even if you catch them now,

27:16.370 --> 27:19.100
obviously, the ship police are
no match for them.

27:20.140 --> 27:21.660
I think what you should do now is

27:21.660 --> 27:23.790
find and gather more ship police here.

27:23.940 --> 27:25.200
It's too late, Cousin.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.980
They will quickly clean up the evidence
and escape.

27:26.980 --> 27:28.340
We must catch them.

27:33.070 --> 27:34.330
As long as we catch one,

27:34.400 --> 27:35.830
I can just go meet Miss Dong,

27:35.830 --> 27:36.830
take her hostage,

27:36.940 --> 27:38.570
make her turn the ship around,

27:38.570 --> 27:40.070
and hurry back to save Shrimpie.

27:40.070 --> 27:40.600
Let's go.

27:41.710 --> 27:46.520
[Third-Class Cabin]

27:54.590 --> 27:56.700
I still underestimated
Twilight Grass Poison.

27:56.700 --> 27:58.100
I need to figure out a way.

27:59.240 --> 28:01.170
Where on earth did Zhang Hailou go?

28:20.410 --> 28:22.830
As expected of you, the lucky dog.

28:24.400 --> 28:24.960
Get down.

28:26.070 --> 28:26.800
Crouch down.

28:27.900 --> 28:28.630
Turn around.

28:29.500 --> 28:30.260
Turn around!

28:32.000 --> 28:32.840
Catch him.

28:33.010 --> 28:33.940
Three, two, one.

28:36.070 --> 28:37.110
What are you doing?

28:37.110 --> 28:38.270
Now you just walk in.

28:38.270 --> 28:40.720
Don't worry.
Those bad guys won't dare to act rashly.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.720
W-Why?

28:42.290 --> 28:44.290
Because they don't know who you are.

28:44.330 --> 28:46.850
So they will only think
you are provoking them.

28:46.850 --> 28:48.580
They'll observe you in secret.

28:50.090 --> 28:50.950
What about you?

28:51.440 --> 28:52.840
Of course, I will observe

28:52.900 --> 28:54.960
them who are observing you in secret.

28:55.720 --> 28:56.290
Go ahead.

28:57.400 --> 28:57.900
I...

28:57.900 --> 28:59.110
I-I can't do it.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.710
Who is this?

29:05.290 --> 29:06.790
Is this person dead?

29:07.570 --> 29:08.480
It's terrifying.

29:08.480 --> 29:10.680
Why is there blood on this person? Look.

29:10.810 --> 29:12.340
Go find the ship police now.

29:14.640 --> 29:15.680
Hurry up.

30:38.980 --> 30:39.790
Zhang Hailou.

31:16.630 --> 31:19.060
[Bai Zhu, Assassin]

31:20.830 --> 31:22.440
Hi, lady.

31:22.440 --> 31:23.200
Hi.

31:29.400 --> 31:31.160
I'll take you upstairs to have dinner.

31:31.160 --> 31:31.880
Hey, bro.

31:32.350 --> 31:34.080
Maybe you're in the wrong seat.

31:34.150 --> 31:37.160
These two girls are the only ones here
who are not afraid of the dead body.

31:37.160 --> 31:38.290
They didn't flinch at all.

31:38.290 --> 31:39.900
One of them is a woman.

31:40.570 --> 31:41.550
I can smell it.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.440
It must be you two.

31:50.440 --> 31:52.530
I didn't expect to meet

31:52.660 --> 31:53.980
two beautiful ladies like you

31:53.980 --> 31:55.010
in this place.

31:55.010 --> 31:57.050
Seems like these two assassins
got separated from their crew.

31:57.050 --> 31:59.450
Let me catch one
and hurry to find Miss Dong.

31:59.660 --> 32:02.060
Actually, if you eat
too much Chinese food,

32:02.090 --> 32:03.850
having Western food occasionally

32:03.850 --> 32:04.980
for a change of taste

32:05.400 --> 32:06.680
is also a good idea.

32:06.680 --> 32:07.200
Yeah.

32:07.200 --> 32:08.530
-Miss?
-I also think so.

32:08.790 --> 32:09.770
Oh, miss...

32:09.810 --> 32:11.270
I've been looking for you.

32:15.810 --> 32:17.200
I followed you all the way here.

32:17.200 --> 32:18.700
Did you drop a handkerchief?

32:18.700 --> 32:20.310
Look, I picked it up to return it to you.

32:20.310 --> 32:21.360
This isn't mine.

32:21.380 --> 32:22.640
Sir, you're mistaken.

32:24.200 --> 32:25.540
How can it not be yours?

32:25.680 --> 32:28.160
You were the only one
walking along the way here.

32:28.160 --> 32:29.900
Even if it's not yours,
just take it for now.

32:29.900 --> 32:30.910
Thank you, sir.

32:31.250 --> 32:33.510
But I never use this kind

32:33.590 --> 32:34.960
of sandalwood-scented handkerchief.

32:34.960 --> 32:35.750
I'm afraid

32:36.110 --> 32:37.920
I have to decline your kindness.

32:39.510 --> 32:40.860
Why wouldn't you use it?

32:42.640 --> 32:44.970
Don't you have a bloodstain on your dress?

32:45.160 --> 32:45.960
Everyone, see if there's

32:45.960 --> 32:47.420
a bloodstain on her dress.

32:49.220 --> 32:50.180
What happened?

32:50.300 --> 32:51.760
What a pity for this dress.

32:52.180 --> 32:53.870
Bai Zhu, look at you.

32:54.010 --> 32:56.390
I told you to be careful in the kitchen.

32:56.570 --> 32:58.700
How did you still get your dress dirty?

32:59.750 --> 33:01.130
I was careless.

33:01.240 --> 33:02.880
Thank you for reminding me, sir.

33:02.880 --> 33:03.880
Don't mention it.

33:03.940 --> 33:06.270
I just think your dress looks pretty nice.

33:06.750 --> 33:08.160
The bloodstain is fresh.

33:08.310 --> 33:09.530
It's still not too late

33:09.530 --> 33:10.930
to wash it off now, right?

33:11.680 --> 33:12.480
Young Lady,

33:13.830 --> 33:16.030
I have nice washing supplies in my room.

33:16.370 --> 33:18.170
You can go there to clean it up.

33:18.240 --> 33:21.270
I promise you'll get a clean dress back.

33:23.750 --> 33:25.800
I will take her to your room.

33:25.980 --> 33:26.980
Listen,

33:27.140 --> 33:28.860
let me take her to your room...

33:29.110 --> 33:30.740
Well, I'm just worried...

33:30.960 --> 33:32.770
You see, there's a motley crew
in the third-class cabin,

33:32.770 --> 33:34.160
with too many eyes watching.

33:34.160 --> 33:35.130
If anything

33:35.660 --> 33:36.800
goes wrong,

33:37.400 --> 33:38.150
and

33:38.310 --> 33:39.860
Miss Dong finds out later

33:41.400 --> 33:42.920
and starts investigating,

33:42.920 --> 33:44.980
we'll have a hard time explaining it.

33:45.610 --> 33:46.090
Okay?

33:46.360 --> 33:46.720
Bro,

33:46.790 --> 33:48.010
tell me your room number.

33:48.010 --> 33:49.010
I'll take her there.

33:49.010 --> 33:49.960
1509.

33:50.350 --> 33:51.160
Let's go.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.150
Sir,

33:52.350 --> 33:53.830
we are accompanying the foreign gentleman.

33:53.830 --> 33:55.830
It has nothing to do with you, right?

33:56.660 --> 33:59.050
Do you want to get involved, too?

34:02.400 --> 34:03.190
Not exactly.

34:03.850 --> 34:05.680
I'm worried
that your foreign language is too poor,

34:05.680 --> 34:07.790
and the foreign gentleman
wouldn't get a hot meal.

34:07.790 --> 34:08.420
Let's go.

34:08.630 --> 34:09.710
What a pity.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.320
You're going to die young.

34:30.280 --> 34:31.030
Bai Zhu,

34:31.550 --> 34:33.710
since this gentleman wants to pursue you,

34:33.710 --> 34:36.820
just try to get along with him properly.

34:40.500 --> 34:41.940
Sir,

34:41.969 --> 34:43.630
I also have some clothes to wash.

34:43.630 --> 34:46.090
How about I go wash them
in my friend's place?

34:46.400 --> 34:47.070
Alright.

34:47.350 --> 34:47.870
Go.

34:49.400 --> 34:50.280
Sir.

34:59.890 --> 35:00.670
Found her!

35:01.150 --> 35:02.730
I smelled it. It was her!

35:02.750 --> 35:04.530
She was the one who fought you just now!

35:04.530 --> 35:06.190
The scent is exactly the same.

35:08.480 --> 35:10.740
Do you know how awkward you are right now?

35:11.360 --> 35:13.090
Do you know you're going to die?

35:13.690 --> 35:15.330
Fire! It's on fire!

35:15.590 --> 35:17.440
Everyone, evacuate to the deck!

35:17.460 --> 35:18.280
Fire!

35:19.280 --> 35:19.880
Run!

35:21.320 --> 35:23.030
Fire! Fire!

35:25.150 --> 35:25.880
It's on fire!

35:26.460 --> 35:27.280
Run!

35:28.510 --> 35:29.290
Go!

36:08.400 --> 36:09.400
Get out of the way!

36:22.510 --> 36:23.360
Plague!

36:25.590 --> 36:26.400
Plague!

36:27.190 --> 36:28.000
It's him?

36:29.150 --> 36:29.760
Plague!

36:30.470 --> 36:31.280
Plague!

36:32.260 --> 36:32.740
Plague!

36:32.770 --> 36:33.770
Hailou's friend.

36:41.430 --> 36:42.240
I can't see!

36:43.230 --> 36:43.760
Hold on to me!

36:43.760 --> 36:44.760
Why is it so dark?

36:47.230 --> 36:48.740
The one with the fluorescent mark
on his back is him.

36:48.740 --> 36:49.960
Guys, get him!

37:55.750 --> 37:58.000
There's Twilight Grass Poison
on the blade.

37:58.000 --> 37:59.530
I must finish this quickly.

40:34.320 --> 40:34.920
Who is it?

40:36.400 --> 40:36.920
Sir,

40:37.390 --> 40:38.190
are you okay?

40:40.070 --> 40:40.800
Blood?

40:41.650 --> 40:42.880
Give this money

40:44.360 --> 40:45.670
to Zhang Hailou.

40:49.170 --> 40:51.230
He's the Plague of Nanyang.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.030
Pardon?

40:52.140 --> 40:53.170
What did you say?

40:59.590 --> 41:00.280
Plague.

41:00.830 --> 41:01.640
Plague!

41:02.070 --> 41:02.940
Plague!
